  data: {
    LLM: "Keep track of the 'Sampah' (the discard pile). If you see others ignoring 8s, it might be easier to collect them.\n\nAvoid holding too many high-value cards (Aces, Kings) if you aren't close to a meld. They represent high negative risk if an opponent goes out.\n\nTiming the 'Remi': Sometimes it's better to wait an extra turn or two to go out with your whole hand (Remi) for a massive score rather than trickle-feeding melds to the table.",
    Player: "Keep track of the 'Sampah' (the discard pile). If you see others ignoring 8s, it might be easier to collect them.\n\nAvoid holding too many high-value cards (Aces, Kings) if you aren't close to a meld. They represent high negative risk if an opponent goes out.\n\nTiming the 'Remi': Sometimes it's better to wait an extra turn or two to go out with your whole hand (Remi) for a massive score rather than trickle-feeding melds to the table.",
